<view class="page bind"><view class="hero"><view class="logo">嘉</view><view class="section-title">绑定您的客户档案</view><view class="muted">绑定后可查看专属商品名称和价格，订单会直接同步给订单员。</view></view><view class="card"><input class="input" placeholder="客户编号，如 K500H" value="{{customerCode}}" bindinput="codeChange"/><input class="input second" type="number" placeholder="后台预留手机号" value="{{phone}}" bindinput="phoneChange"/><button class="primary" loading="{{submitting}}" bindtap="bindCustomer">立即绑定</button></view><view class="tip">客户编号和手机号由您的订单员在“客户管理”中维护，如不清楚请联系订单员。</view></view>
